bucharest-lite (1.9.15-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 1.9.15: proxy editing infrastructure — auto-generate low-res proxies for smooth 4K+ editing
    - Global "Use Proxies" toolbar button
    - Proxy status badges on timeline clips (✓/⟳/✕ indicators)
    - Per-clip proxy override persistence in project JSON
    - Proxy preferences dialog (directory, threshold, CRF, codec, concurrency)
    - Proxy cleanup when media removed from bin
    - Proxy generation progress in status bar
    - Undo/redo history panel (View → Undo History…, Ctrl+7)
    - Regression fixes: timeline lane heights, EditMode restore clamp, codec-aware proxy FFmpeg args, shell-free runProcess

